      "titleZh": "Gemini Robotics 2 为机器人带来全身智能",
      "titleEn": "Gemini Robotics 2 brings whole body intelligence to robots",
      "summaryZh": "Google DeepMind 发布了 Gemini Robotics 2，这是一个新的 AI 模型，旨在为机器人提供全身控制能力，使其能够执行复杂的物理任务。该模型整合了视觉、语言和动作，使机器人能够理解环境并做出反应。",
      "summaryEn": "Google DeepMind has released Gemini Robotics 2, a new AI model designed to give robots whole-body control, enabling them to perform complex physical tasks. The model integrates vision, language, and action, allowing robots to understand and react to their environment.",
      "keywords": [
        "Gemini Robotics 2",
